'''''Tintin and the World of Hergé: An Illustrated History''''' ({{langx|fr|link=no|'''Le monde d'Hergé'''}}) is a book by [[Benoit Peeters]] chronicling the illustrated history of Belgian cartoonist [[Hergé]] and his creation ''[[The Adventures of Tintin]]''.

